  "prompt": "Voltmarkt gives priority handling to order lines that ship to Belgium or Luxembourg and are worth 100.00 euro or more. Use the sales table, where country_code is the country an order ships to, and keep the order lines of orders 1 to 10 (order_id from 1 to 10, both included). Return four columns, in this order: order_line_id, country_code, net_revenue_eur and priority. priority is the text 'yes' when country_code is 'BE' or 'LU' and net_revenue_eur is 100.00 or more, and 'no' for every other line, including a line whose net_revenue_eur is missing. Return one row per order line. Any row order is fine.",
